const ORDER = ["8급","준7급","7급","준6급","6급","준5급","5급","준4급","4급","준3급","3급","2급","1급","준특급","특급"];
const COLORS = ["#6E9C7E","#5F9482","#4F8B86","#47818C","#47758F","#4E6A8E","#5C6089","#6B5780","#7A5075","#884B67","#944859","#9E4A4A","#A5553C","#A66430","#9E7326"];
const ALIAS = {"준7급":"7급Ⅱ","준6급":"6급Ⅱ","준5급":"5급Ⅱ","준4급":"4급Ⅱ","준3급":"3급Ⅱ","준특급":"특급Ⅱ"};
const HARD = new Set(["1급","준특급","특급"]);          // 합격선 80%
const SET_SIZE = 10;
const TONE = ["단음","장음","장단음"];
// [한자, 훈음, 부수, 획수, 음(|), 장단]
const H=0, R=1, B=2, S_=3, E=4, T=5;

const CUM = {};                                          // 누적 시험 범위
(function(){ let acc=[]; for(const lv of ORDER){ acc = acc.concat(DATA[lv]||[]); CUM[lv]=acc.slice(); } })();

const mem={};
const store={
  async get(k){ try{const r=await window.storage.get(k);return r?JSON.parse(r.value):null}catch(e){return mem[k]??null} },
  async set(k,v){ mem[k]=v; try{await window.storage.set(k,JSON.stringify(v))}catch(e){} }
};
let known={}, saveTimer=null;
const saveSoon=()=>{clearTimeout(saveTimer);saveTimer=setTimeout(()=>store.set('hanja:known',known),800)};

const S={level:"8급",set:0,mode:"card",sub:"mean",cum:false,i:0,flipped:false,streak:0,best:0,quiz:null,exam:null,radical:null};
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
const esc=s=>String(s).replace(/[&<>"]/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;'}[c]));
const scope=()=>S.cum?(CUM[S.level]||[]):(DATA[S.level]||[]);
const setCount=()=>Math.max(1,Math.ceil(scope().length/SET_SIZE));
const curSet=()=>scope().slice(S.set*SET_SIZE,S.set*SET_SIZE+SET_SIZE);
const shuffle=a=>{for(let i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){const j=(Math.random()*(i+1))|0;[a[i],a[j]]=[a[j],a[i]]}return a};
const pick=a=>a[(Math.random()*a.length)|0];
const cut=s=>s.replace(/\s*\(:\)|:/g,'');

function levelColor(){document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--lv',COLORS[ORDER.indexOf(S.level)]||COLORS[0])}

function drawLevels(){
  $('levels').innerHTML=ORDER.map((lv,i)=>{
    const n=(DATA[lv]||[]).length, on=lv===S.level;
    return `<button class="chip" data-lv="${lv}" aria-pressed="${on}" style="--c:${COLORS[i]}"><span class="dot"></span>${lv}${ALIAS[lv]?`<span class="n">${ALIAS[lv]}</span>`:''}<span class="n">${n}자</span></button>`;
  }).join('');
  const el=$('levels').querySelector('[aria-pressed="true"]'); if(el) el.scrollIntoView({block:'nearest',inline:'center'});
}
function drawSub(){
  const all=ORDER.reduce((a,lv)=>a+(DATA[lv]||[]).length,0);
  $('sub').innerHTML=`익힌 한자 ${Object.keys(known).length.toLocaleString()} / ${all.toLocaleString()}<br>연속 <b>${S.streak}</b> · 최고 ${S.best}`;
}

/* ── 급수/묶음 컨텍스트 바 ── */
function drawContext(){
  const c=$('context');
  if(S.mode==='exam'||S.mode==='find'){ c.innerHTML=''; return; }
  const p=scope(), d=p.filter(x=>known[x[H]]).length;
  const sets=Array.from({length:setCount()},(_,i)=>{
    const a=i*SET_SIZE+1,b=Math.min((i+1)*SET_SIZE,p.length);
    const ch=p.slice(i*SET_SIZE,i*SET_SIZE+SET_SIZE);
    return `<button class="chip sm" data-set="${i}" aria-pressed="${i===S.set}" style="--c:var(--lv)"><span class="dot"></span>${a}–${b}${ch.every(x=>known[x[H]])?' ✓':''}</button>`;
  }).join('');
  c.innerHTML=`
    <div class="metarow">
      <button class="toggle" id="cum" aria-pressed="${S.cum}">${S.cum?'시험 범위(누적)':'이 급수만'}</button>
      <span><b>${d}</b> / ${p.length}자 익힘</span>
    </div>
    <div class="meter"><i style="width:${p.length?d/p.length*100:0}%"></i></div>
    <div class="scroller" id="sets">${sets}</div>`;
  const el=c.querySelector('[aria-pressed="true"][data-set]'); if(el) el.scrollIntoView({block:'nearest',inline:'center'});
}

/* ── 1. 카드 ── */
function renderCard(){
  const set=curSet();
  if(!set.length){ $('stage').innerHTML=`<div class="empty">한자가 없어요.</div>`; $('foot').innerHTML=''; return; }
  S.i=Math.min(S.i,set.length-1);
  const c=set[S.i], tcls=c[T]===1?'long':c[T]===2?'both':'';
  $('stage').innerHTML=`
    <div class="card${S.flipped?' flipped':''}" id="card" role="button" tabindex="0">
      <div class="face front"><span class="badge">${lvOf(c)}</span><span class="glyph">${c[H]}</span><span class="hint">눌러서 뜻·음 보기</span></div>
      <div class="face back">
        <span class="badge">${lvOf(c)}</span><span class="tone ${tcls}">${TONE[c[T]]}</span>
        <span class="reading">${esc(c[R])}</span>
        <span class="meta">부수 <b>${c[B]}</b> · 총 <b>${c[S_]}획</b></span>
        ${YAKJA[c[H]]?`<span class="meta">약자 <b style="font-size:20px">${YAKJA[c[H]]}</b></span>`:''}
        <span class="hint">눌러서 한자 보기</span>
      </div>
      <div class="seal-mark" id="seal">合</div>
    </div>
    <div class="nav">
      <button class="round" id="prev" ${S.i===0?'disabled':''}>←</button>
      <span class="pos">${S.i+1} / ${set.length}</span>
      <button class="round" id="next" ${S.i===set.length-1?'disabled':''}>→</button>
    </div>
    <button class="btn ghost" id="toStroke">획순 보기 ✍</button>`;
  $('foot').innerHTML=`<button class="btn ghost" id="again">다시 볼래요</button><button class="btn solid" id="got">${known[c[H]]?'익힘 ✓':'외웠어요'}</button>`;
}
const LVOF={};
(function(){ for(const lv of ORDER) for(const c of (DATA[lv]||[])) LVOF[c[H]]=lv; })();
const lvOf=c=>LVOF[c[H]]||S.level;

/* ── 2. 획순 ── */
let hwLoaded=null, writer=null;
function loadHW(){
  if(hwLoaded) return hwLoaded;
  hwLoaded=new Promise((res,rej)=>{
    const s=document.createElement('script');
    s.src='https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/hanzi-writer@3.7.0/dist/hanzi-writer.min.js';
    s.onload=res; s.onerror=rej; document.head.appendChild(s);
  });
  return hwLoaded;
}
function renderStroke(){
  const set=curSet();
  if(!set.length){ $('stage').innerHTML=`<div class="empty">한자가 없어요.</div>`; $('foot').innerHTML=''; return; }
  S.i=Math.min(S.i,set.length-1);
  const c=set[S.i];
  $('stage').innerHTML=`
    <div class="strokebox">
      <div id="hw"><div class="gridbg"></div><div class="nodata" id="hwmsg">획순 불러오는 중…</div></div>
      <div class="strokeinfo"><span>${esc(c[R])}</span><span>부수 <b>${c[B]}</b></span><span>총 <b>${c[S_]}획</b></span></div>
      <div class="hwbtns">
        <button class="btn ghost" id="play">다시 보기 ▶</button>
        <button class="btn solid" id="trace">따라쓰기 ✍</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="nav">
      <button class="round" id="prev" ${S.i===0?'disabled':''}>←</button>
      <span class="pos">${S.i+1} / ${set.length}</span>
      <button class="round" id="next" ${S.i===set.length-1?'disabled':''}>→</button>
    </div>`;
  $('foot').innerHTML=`<button class="btn ghost" id="toCard">카드로 보기</button><button class="btn solid" id="got">${known[c[H]]?'익힘 ✓':'외웠어요'}</button>`;
  mountWriter(c[H]);
}
function mountWriter(ch){
  const box=$('hw'); if(!box) return;
  loadHW().then(()=>{
    if(!$('hw')) return;
    const size=Math.min(Math.round(window.innerWidth*.72),260);
    box.innerHTML=`<div class="gridbg"></div><div id="hwtarget"></div>`;
    writer=HanziWriter.create('hwtarget',ch,{
      width:size,height:size,padding:8,
      strokeColor:'#14181A',radicalColor:'#BE3A2B',outlineColor:'#C7CABD',
      drawingColor:'#4F7C6E',drawingWidth:22,
      showOutline:true,strokeAnimationSpeed:.9,delayBetweenStrokes:180,
      charDataLoader:(c2,onLoad,onErr)=>{
        fetch(`https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/hanzi-writer-data@2.0/${encodeURIComponent(c2)}.json`)
          .then(r=>r.ok?r.json():Promise.reject()).then(onLoad).catch(onErr);
      },
      onLoadCharDataError:()=>{
        writer=null;
        if($('hw')) $('hw').innerHTML=`<div class="gridbg"></div><div class="nodata">이 한자는 획순 데이터가 없어요.<br>총 획수와 부수로 확인해 주세요.</div>`;
      }
    });
    writer.animateCharacter();
  }).catch(()=>{
    if($('hw')) $('hw').innerHTML=`<div class="gridbg"></div><div class="nodata">획순을 불러오지 못했어요.<br>인터넷 연결을 확인해 주세요.</div>`;
  });
}

/* ── 3. 문제 ── */
const SUBS=[["mean","뜻·음"],["glyph","한자"],["radical","부수"],["tone","장단음"],["stroke","획수"],["yakja","약자"]];
function buildQuiz(){
  let list=curSet().slice();
  if(S.sub==='yakja'){
    list=(S.cum?CUM[S.level]:DATA[S.level]||[]).filter(x=>YAKJA[x[H]]);
    if(list.length<4) list=(CUM[S.level]||[]).filter(x=>YAKJA[x[H]]);
    list=shuffle(list).slice(0,10);
  }
  S.quiz={list:shuffle(list),i:0,right:0,wrong:[],opts:null};
}
function makeOpts(item,kind){
  const p=scope().length>=12?scope():CUM[S.level];
  const key=o=>kind==='mean'?cut(o[R]):kind==='glyph'?o[H]:kind==='radical'?o[B]:kind==='yakja'?YAKJA[o[H]]:String(o[S_]);
  const src=kind==='yakja'?p.filter(x=>YAKJA[x[H]]):p;
  const opts=[item], seen=new Set([key(item)]);
  for(let g=0;g<800&&opts.length<4;g++){ const c=pick(src); if(!c||seen.has(key(c)))continue; seen.add(key(c)); opts.push(c); }
  return shuffle(opts);
}
function renderQuiz(){
  if(!S.quiz) buildQuiz();
  const q=S.quiz;
  $('stage').insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin','');
  if(!q.list.length){ $('stage').innerHTML=`<div class="modebar" id="subbar">${SUBS.map(([v,n])=>`<button data-sub="${v}" aria-pressed="${v===S.sub}">${n}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="empty">이 급수 범위에는 약자가 지정된 한자가 없어요.<br>더 높은 급수를 골라 보세요.</div>`; $('foot').innerHTML=''; return; }
  if(q.i>=q.list.length) return renderQuizDone();
  const item=q.list[q.i], k=S.sub;
  if(!q.opts) q.opts = k==='tone' ? [0,1,2] : makeOpts(item,k);

  const subbar=`<div class="modebar" id="subbar">${SUBS.map(([v,n])=>`<button data-sub="${v}" aria-pressed="${v===S.sub}">${n}</button>`).join('')}</div>`;
  let prompt, opts;
  if(k==='mean'){ prompt=`<div class="qlabel">이 한자의 뜻과 음은?</div><div class="glyph">${item[H]}</div>`;
    opts=q.opts.map((o,n)=>`<button class="opt" data-n="${n}"><span class="k">${n+1}</span>${esc(o[R])}</button>`).join(''); }
  else if(k==='glyph'){ prompt=`<div class="qlabel">이 뜻과 음을 가진 한자는?</div><div class="qreading">${esc(item[R])}</div>`;
    opts=q.opts.map((o,n)=>`<button class="opt han" data-n="${n}">${o[H]}</button>`).join(''); }
  else if(k==='radical'){ prompt=`<div class="qlabel">이 한자의 부수는?</div><div class="glyph">${item[H]}</div><div style="font-size:13px;opacity:.6">${esc(item[R])}</div>`;
    opts=q.opts.map((o,n)=>`<button class="opt han" data-n="${n}">${o[B]}</button>`).join(''); }
  else if(k==='stroke'){ prompt=`<div class="qlabel">이 한자의 총 획수는?</div><div class="glyph">${item[H]}</div>`;
    opts=q.opts.map((o,n)=>`<button class="opt" data-n="${n}"><span class="k">${n+1}</span>${o[S_]}획</button>`).join(''); }
  else if(k==='yakja'){ prompt=`<div class="qlabel">이 한자의 약자는?</div><div class="glyph">${item[H]}</div><div style="font-size:13px;opacity:.6">${esc(cut(item[R]))}</div>`;
    opts=q.opts.map((o,n)=>`<button class="opt han" data-n="${n}">${YAKJA[o[H]]}</button>`).join(''); }
  else { prompt=`<div class="qlabel">이 한자 첫소리의 길이는?</div><div class="glyph">${item[H]}</div><div style="font-size:13px;opacity:.6">${esc(cut(item[R]))}</div>`;
    opts=[0,1,2].map(n=>`<button class="opt" data-n="${n}"><span class="k">${n+1}</span>${TONE[n]}</button>`).join(''); }

  $('stage').innerHTML=`${subbar}
    <div class="qcard">${prompt}<div class="seal-mark" id="seal">合</div></div>
    <div class="nav" style="margin-top:0"><span class="pos">${q.i+1} / ${q.list.length} · 맞힘 ${q.right}</span></div>
    <div class="opts" id="opts">${opts}</div>`;
  $('foot').innerHTML=`<button class="btn ghost" id="skip">건너뛰기</button><button class="btn solid" id="requiz">처음부터</button>`;
}
function answerQuiz(n){
  const q=S.quiz,item=q.list[q.i],k=S.sub;
  const ok = k==='tone' ? n===item[T] : (()=>{ const o=q.opts[n];
    return k==='mean'?cut(o[R])===cut(item[R]):k==='glyph'?o[H]===item[H]:k==='radical'?o[B]===item[B]:k==='yakja'?YAKJA[o[H]]===YAKJA[item[H]]:o[S_]===item[S_]; })();
  const isRight = i => k==='tone' ? i===item[T] : (()=>{ const o=q.opts[i];
    return k==='mean'?cut(o[R])===cut(item[R]):k==='glyph'?o[H]===item[H]:k==='radical'?o[B]===item[B]:k==='yakja'?YAKJA[o[H]]===YAKJA[item[H]]:o[S_]===item[S_]; })();
  document.querySelectorAll('.opt').forEach((b,i)=>{ b.disabled=true; if(isRight(i))b.classList.add('right'); else if(i===n)b.classList.add('wrong'); });
  if(ok){ q.right++; S.streak++; S.best=Math.max(S.best,S.streak); known[item[H]]=1; }
  else { q.wrong.push(item); S.streak=0; delete known[item[H]]; }
  saveSoon(); stamp(ok); drawSub();
  setTimeout(()=>{ q.i++; q.opts=null; drawContext(); renderQuiz(); }, ok?620:1150);
}
function renderQuizDone(){
  const q=S.quiz,pct=Math.round(q.right/q.list.length*100);
  $('stage').innerHTML=`<div class="panel" style="text-align:center">
    <div class="big ${pct>=70?'pass':'fail'}">${pct}점</div>
    <p style="margin-top:6px">${q.list.length}문항 중 ${q.right}문항 정답</p>
    ${q.wrong.length?`<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-3)">틀린 한자</div><div class="wronglist" style="justify-content:center">${q.wrong.map(w=>`<span>${w[H]}</span>`).join('')}</div>`:''}
  </div>`;
  $('foot').innerHTML=`<button class="btn ghost" id="requiz">다시 풀기</button><button class="btn solid" id="nextset">다음 묶음 →</button>`;
}

/* ── 4. 모의고사 ── */
const KINDS={
  eum:{name:'독음',ask:'한자의 음을 쓰세요',type:'input'},
  hun:{name:'훈음',ask:'한자의 뜻과 음은?',type:'choice'},
  write:{name:'한자쓰기',ask:'뜻과 음에 맞는 한자는?',type:'choice'},
  rad:{name:'부수',ask:'한자의 부수는?',type:'choice'},
  tone:{name:'장단음',ask:'첫소리의 길이는?',type:'choice'},
  stroke:{name:'획수',ask:'한자의 총 획수는?',type:'choice'},
  yakja:{name:'약자',ask:'한자의 약자는?',type:'choice'}
};
function planFor(level,total){
  const i=ORDER.indexOf(level);
  let w;
  if(i<=3)      w={eum:.40,hun:.40,stroke:.20};                                  // 8급~준6급
  else if(i===4)w={eum:.34,hun:.28,write:.20,stroke:.18};                        // 6급
  else if(i<=6) w={eum:.32,hun:.26,write:.18,stroke:.16,yakja:.08};              // 준5급~5급
  else if(i<=8) w={eum:.30,hun:.22,write:.18,rad:.12,tone:.12,yakja:.06};        // 준4급~4급
  else          w={eum:.28,hun:.22,write:.18,rad:.12,tone:.12,yakja:.08};        // 준3급 이상
  const plan=[],keys=Object.keys(w);
  keys.forEach(k=>{ for(let n=0;n<Math.round(w[k]*total);n++) plan.push(k); });
  while(plan.length<total) plan.push('eum');
  return shuffle(plan.slice(0,total));
}
function buildExam(total){
  const p=CUM[S.level]||[], plan=planFor(S.level,total);
  const yp=p.filter(x=>YAKJA[x[H]]);
  const used=new Set();
  const items=plan.map(kind=>{
    let k=kind;
    if(k==='yakja'&&yp.length<4) k='hun';
    const src=k==='yakja'?yp:p;
    let it=pick(src);
    for(let g=0;g<80;g++){ const c=pick(src); if(!used.has(c[H])){ it=c; break; } }
    used.add(it[H]);
    const o={kind:k,item:it,answer:null};
    if(k==='hun') o.opts=makeExamOpts(p,it,'mean');
    if(k==='write') o.opts=makeExamOpts(p,it,'glyph');
    if(k==='rad') o.opts=makeExamOpts(p,it,'radical');
    if(k==='stroke') o.opts=makeExamOpts(p,it,'stroke');
    if(k==='yakja') o.opts=makeExamOpts(yp,it,'yakja');
    return o;
  });
  S.exam={items,i:0,started:Date.now(),done:false,checked:false};
}
function makeExamOpts(p,item,kind){
  const key=o=>kind==='mean'?cut(o[R]):kind==='glyph'?o[H]:kind==='radical'?o[B]:kind==='yakja'?YAKJA[o[H]]:String(o[S_]);
  const opts=[item],seen=new Set([key(item)]);
  for(let g=0;g<500&&opts.length<4;g++){const c=pick(p);if(seen.has(key(c)))continue;seen.add(key(c));opts.push(c)}
  return shuffle(opts);
}
function examCorrect(q){
  const it=q.item;
  if(q.answer==null||q.answer==='') return false;
  if(q.kind==='eum') return it[E].split('|').includes(String(q.answer).trim());
  if(q.kind==='tone') return q.answer===it[T];
  const o=q.opts[q.answer];
  return q.kind==='hun'?cut(o[R])===cut(it[R]):q.kind==='write'?o[H]===it[H]:q.kind==='rad'?o[B]===it[B]:q.kind==='yakja'?YAKJA[o[H]]===YAKJA[it[H]]:o[S_]===it[S_];
}
function renderExamIntro(){
  const lv=S.level, need=HARD.has(lv)?80:70, n=(CUM[lv]||[]).length;
  $('stage').innerHTML=`<div class="panel">
    <h2>${lv}${ALIAS[lv]?` (${ALIAS[lv]})`:''} 모의고사</h2>
    <p>시험 범위 ${n.toLocaleString()}자에서 무작위로 출제해요. 합격선은 <b>${need}%</b>입니다.</p>
    <div class="pickrow">
      ${[20,40,60].map(v=>`<button class="chip" data-len="${v}" aria-pressed="${(S.examLen||40)===v}" style="--c:var(--lv)"><span class="dot"></span>${v}문항</button>`).join('')}
    </div>
    <div class="note">
      출제 영역은 독음·훈음·한자쓰기·부수·장단음·획수·약자예요. 장단음과 부수는 4급Ⅱ 이상, 약자는 5급Ⅱ 이상, 획수(필순)는 5급 이하 시험에 나오는 유형이라 급수에 맞춰 자동으로 섞입니다.<br><br>
      실제 시험에는 반의어·유의어·완성형·뜻풀이 같은 낱말 유형도 나와요. 그 부분은 이 앱에서 다루지 않으니 문제집과 함께 보시면 좋아요. 약자 목록도 공식 자료가 아니라 정리본이라 문제집과 한 번 대조해 보세요.<br><br>
      합격 기준은 한국어문회 안내 기준(특급·특급Ⅱ·1급 80% 이상, 2급~8급 70% 이상)을 따랐습니다.
    </div>
  </div>`;
  $('foot').innerHTML=`<div class="wrap one" style="padding:0"><button class="btn solid" id="startexam">시험 시작</button></div>`;
  $('foot').className='wrap one';
}
function renderExam(){
  const x=S.exam;
  if(!x) return renderExamIntro();
  if(x.done) return renderExamResult();
  const q=x.items[x.i], it=q.item, K=KINDS[q.kind];
  const mins=Math.floor((Date.now()-x.started)/60000), secs=Math.floor((Date.now()-x.started)/1000)%60;
  let prompt,body;
  if(q.kind!=='write')
    prompt=`<div class="glyph">${it[H]}</div>${(q.kind==='tone'||q.kind==='rad'||q.kind==='yakja')?`<div style="font-size:13px;opacity:.6">${esc(cut(it[R]))}</div>`:''}`;
  else prompt=`<div class="qreading">${esc(it[R])}</div>`;

  if(q.kind==='eum') body=`<div class="typed"><input id="ans" inputmode="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="음을 한글로" value="${esc(q.answer||'')}"><button id="submit">확인</button></div>`;
  else if(q.kind==='tone') body=`<div class="opts">${[0,1,2].map(n=>`<button class="opt" data-en="${n}" ${q.answer===n?'style="border-color:var(--lv)"':''}><span class="k">${n+1}</span>${TONE[n]}</button>`).join('')}</div>`;
  else body=`<div class="opts">${q.opts.map((o,n)=>{
      const txt=q.kind==='hun'?esc(o[R]):q.kind==='write'?o[H]:q.kind==='rad'?o[B]:q.kind==='yakja'?YAKJA[o[H]]:o[S_]+'획';
      const han=(q.kind==='write'||q.kind==='rad'||q.kind==='yakja')?' han':'';
      return `<button class="opt${han}" data-en="${n}" ${q.answer===n?'style="border-color:var(--lv);background:var(--celadon-2)"':''}>${han?'':`<span class="k">${n+1}</span>`}${txt}</button>`;
    }).join('')}</div>`;

  $('stage').innerHTML=`
    <div class="examhead"><span><b>${x.i+1}</b> / ${x.items.length} · ${K.name}</span><span>⏱ <b>${String(mins).padStart(2,'0')}:${String(secs).padStart(2,'0')}</b></span></div>
    <div class="qcard"><div class="qlabel">${K.ask}</div>${prompt}</div>
    ${body}`;
  $('foot').className='wrap';
  $('foot').innerHTML=`<button class="btn ghost" id="eprev" ${x.i===0?'disabled':''}>← 이전</button>
    <button class="btn ${x.i===x.items.length-1?'seal':'solid'}" id="enext">${x.i===x.items.length-1?'채점하기':'다음 →'}</button>`;
  const inp=$('ans'); if(inp){ inp.focus(); inp.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{ if(e.key==='Enter'){ q.answer=inp.value; nextExam(); } }); }
}
function nextExam(){
  const x=S.exam, inp=$('ans');
  if(inp) x.items[x.i].answer=inp.value;
  if(x.i===x.items.length-1){ x.done=true; x.elapsed=Date.now()-x.started; x.items.forEach(q=>{ if(examCorrect(q)) known[q.item[H]]=1; }); saveSoon(); drawSub(); return renderExamResult(); }
  x.i++; renderExam();
}
function renderExamResult(){
  const x=S.exam, right=x.items.filter(examCorrect).length, total=x.items.length;
  const pct=Math.round(right/total*100), need=HARD.has(S.level)?80:70, pass=pct>=need;
  const byKind={};
  x.items.forEach(q=>{ const k=q.kind; byKind[k]=byKind[k]||[0,0]; byKind[k][1]++; if(examCorrect(q)) byKind[k][0]++; });
  const wrong=x.items.filter(q=>!examCorrect(q));
  const m=Math.floor((x.elapsed||0)/60000), s=Math.floor((x.elapsed||0)/1000)%60;
  $('stage').innerHTML=`<div class="panel" style="text-align:center">
      <div class="big ${pass?'pass':'fail'}">${right}<span style="font-size:20px;color:var(--ink-3)"> / ${total}</span></div>
      <p style="margin:8px 0 16px">${pass?`합격선 ${need}%를 넘었어요`:`합격선 ${need}% · ${Math.ceil(total*need/100)-right}문항 모자라요`} · ${m}분 ${s}초</p>
      <div style="text-align:left">${Object.entries(byKind).map(([k,v])=>`<div class="stat"><span>${KINDS[k].name}</span><b>${v[0]} / ${v[1]}</b></div>`).join('')}</div>
    </div>
    ${wrong.length?`<div class="panel" style="margin-top:10px">
      <h2 style="font-size:15px">틀린 문제 ${wrong.length}개</h2>
      ${wrong.slice(0,30).map(q=>`<div class="row" style="margin-top:6px"><span class="g">${q.item[H]}</span><span class="t"><b>${esc(q.item[R])}</b><i>${KINDS[q.kind].name} · 부수 ${q.item[B]} · ${q.item[S_]}획 · ${TONE[q.item[T]]}${YAKJA[q.item[H]]?' · 약자 '+YAKJA[q.item[H]]:''}</i></span></div>`).join('')}
    </div>`:''}`;
  $('foot').className='wrap';
  $('foot').innerHTML=`<button class="btn ghost" id="examagain">다시 보기</button><button class="btn solid" id="examnew">새 문제로</button>`;
}

/* ── 5. 찾기 ── */
let listN=40,listQ='',findTab='word';
function renderFind(){
  const subbar=`<div class="modebar"><button data-find="word" aria-pressed="${findTab==='word'}">한자 찾기</button><button data-find="rad" aria-pressed="${findTab==='rad'}">부수 색인</button></div>`;
  if(findTab==='rad') return renderRadicals(subbar);
  const q=listQ.trim();
  let src=q?ORDER.flatMap(lv=>(DATA[lv]||[]).map(x=>[x,lv])):(CUM[S.level]||[]).map(x=>[x,LVOF[x[H]]]);
  if(q) src=src.filter(([x])=>x[H]===q||x[R].includes(q)||x[B]===q||x[E].split('|').includes(q));
  const shown=src.slice(0,listN);
  $('stage').innerHTML=`${subbar}
    <input class="search" id="q" placeholder="한자 · 뜻 · 음 · 부수로 찾기" value="${esc(listQ)}">
    ${shown.length?shown.map(([x,lv])=>rowHtml(x,lv)).join(''):`<div class="empty">찾는 한자가 없어요.<br>다른 말로 찾아보세요.</div>`}
    ${src.length>listN?`<button class="more" id="more">${(src.length-listN).toLocaleString()}자 더 보기</button>`:''}`;
  $('foot').className='wrap';
  $('foot').innerHTML=`<button class="btn ghost" id="clearq">검색 지우기</button><button class="btn solid" id="toCard">카드로 공부</button>`;
  const inp=$('q');
  inp.addEventListener('input',e=>{ listQ=e.target.value; listN=40; const p=e.target.selectionStart; renderFind(); const n=$('q'); n.focus(); n.setSelectionRange(p,p); });
}
const rowHtml=(x,lv)=>`<div class="row"><span class="g">${x[H]}</span><span class="t"><b>${esc(x[R])}</b><i>${lv} · 부수 ${x[B]} · ${x[S_]}획 · ${TONE[x[T]]}${YAKJA[x[H]]?' · 약자 '+YAKJA[x[H]]:''}</i></span><button class="mk${known[x[H]]?' on':''}" data-h="${x[H]}">✓</button></div>`;
function renderRadicals(subbar){
  const p=CUM[S.level]||[], by={};
  p.forEach(x=>{ (by[x[B]]=by[x[B]]||[]).push(x); });
  const rads=Object.entries(by).sort((a,b)=>b[1].length-a[1].length);
  const sel=S.radical&&by[S.radical]?by[S.radical]:null;
  $('stage').innerHTML=`${subbar}
    <div class="metarow"><span>${S.level} 범위 부수 ${rads.length}개</span>${sel?`<button class="toggle" id="clearrad">전체 보기</button>`:''}</div>
    ${sel?'':`<div class="radgrid">${rads.map(([r,a])=>`<button data-rad="${r}" aria-pressed="false"><b>${r}</b><i>${a.length}자</i></button>`).join('')}</div>`}
    ${sel?`<div class="radgrid" style="margin-bottom:10px"><button data-rad="${S.radical}" aria-pressed="true"><b>${S.radical}</b><i>${sel.length}자</i></button></div>
      ${sel.slice(0,120).map(x=>rowHtml(x,LVOF[x[H]])).join('')}`:''}`;
  $('foot').className='wrap';
  $('foot').innerHTML=`<button class="btn ghost" id="radquiz">부수 문제 풀기</button><button class="btn solid" id="toCard">카드로 공부</button>`;
}

/* ── 라우터 ── */
function render(){
  levelColor(); drawLevels(); drawSub(); drawContext();
  document.querySelectorAll('#modebar button').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',b.dataset.mode===S.mode));
  $('foot').className='wrap';
  if(S.mode==='card') renderCard();
  else if(S.mode==='stroke') renderStroke();
  else if(S.mode==='quiz') renderQuiz();
  else if(S.mode==='exam') renderExam();
  else renderFind();
}
function stamp(ok){
  const s=$('seal'); if(!s) return;
  s.textContent=ok?'合':'×'; s.style.borderColor=s.style.color=ok?'var(--seal)':'var(--ink-3)';
  s.classList.remove('show'); void s.offsetWidth; s.classList.add('show');
}

document.addEventListener('click',e=>{
  const t=e.target.closest('button, .card'); if(!t) return;
  const d=t.dataset;

  if(d.lv){ S.level=d.lv; S.set=0; S.i=0; S.flipped=false; S.quiz=null; S.exam=null; S.radical=null; listN=40; return render(); }
  if(d.set!==undefined&&d.set!==''){ S.set=+d.set; S.i=0; S.flipped=false; S.quiz=null; return render(); }
  if(d.mode){ S.mode=d.mode; S.i=0; S.flipped=false; S.quiz=null; if(d.mode!=='exam')S.exam=null; return render(); }
  if(d.sub){ S.sub=d.sub; buildQuiz(); return render(); }
  if(d.find){ findTab=d.find; S.radical=null; return renderFind(); }
  if(t.id==='cum'){ S.cum=!S.cum; S.set=0; S.i=0; S.quiz=null; return render(); }

  if(t.id==='card'){ S.flipped=!S.flipped; t.classList.toggle('flipped'); return; }
  if(t.id==='prev'){ S.i--; S.flipped=false; return S.mode==='stroke'?renderStroke():renderCard(); }
  if(t.id==='next'){ S.i++; S.flipped=false; return S.mode==='stroke'?renderStroke():renderCard(); }
  if(t.id==='toStroke'){ S.mode='stroke'; return render(); }
  if(t.id==='toCard'){ S.mode='card'; S.i=0; S.flipped=false; return render(); }
  if(t.id==='play'){ if(writer) writer.animateCharacter(); return; }
  if(t.id==='trace'){ if(writer) writer.quiz({onComplete:()=>stamp(true)}); return; }
  if(t.id==='again'){ const c=curSet()[S.i]; delete known[c[H]]; saveSoon(); if(S.i<curSet().length-1){S.i++;S.flipped=false;} drawSub(); drawContext(); return renderCard(); }
  if(t.id==='got'){
    const c=curSet()[S.i]; known[c[H]]=1; saveSoon(); stamp(true); drawSub();
    setTimeout(()=>{ if(S.i<curSet().length-1){S.i++;S.flipped=false;} drawContext(); S.mode==='stroke'?renderStroke():renderCard(); },420);
    return;
  }

  if(d.n!==undefined&&t.classList.contains('opt')&&S.mode==='quiz') return answerQuiz(+d.n);
  if(t.id==='skip'){ S.quiz.i++; S.quiz.opts=null; return renderQuiz(); }
  if(t.id==='requiz'){ buildQuiz(); return renderQuiz(); }
  if(t.id==='nextset'){ S.set=Math.min(S.set+1,setCount()-1); S.quiz=null; return render(); }

  if(d.len){ S.examLen=+d.len; return renderExamIntro(); }
  if(t.id==='startexam'){ buildExam(S.examLen||40); return renderExam(); }
  if(d.en!==undefined){ S.exam.items[S.exam.i].answer=+d.en; return renderExam(); }
  if(t.id==='enext'){ return nextExam(); }
  if(t.id==='eprev'){ const inp=$('ans'); if(inp)S.exam.items[S.exam.i].answer=inp.value; S.exam.i--; return renderExam(); }
  if(t.id==='submit'){ return nextExam(); }
  if(t.id==='examagain'){ S.exam.done=false; S.exam.i=0; S.exam.started=Date.now(); return renderExam(); }
  if(t.id==='examnew'){ S.exam=null; return renderExamIntro(); }

  if(d.h){ const h=d.h; if(known[h])delete known[h]; else known[h]=1; saveSoon(); t.classList.toggle('on'); drawSub(); return; }
  if(d.rad){ S.radical=S.radical===d.rad?null:d.rad; return renderFind(); }
  if(t.id==='clearrad'){ S.radical=null; return renderFind(); }
  if(t.id==='more'){ listN+=60; return renderFind(); }
  if(t.id==='clearq'){ listQ=''; listN=40; return renderFind(); }
  if(t.id==='radquiz'){ S.mode='quiz'; S.sub='radical'; buildQuiz(); return render(); }
});

document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{
  if(e.target.tagName==='INPUT') return;
  if(S.mode==='card'){
    if(e.key===' '||e.key==='Enter'){ e.preventDefault(); const c=$('card'); if(c){S.flipped=!S.flipped;c.classList.toggle('flipped')} }
    if(e.key==='ArrowLeft'&&S.i>0){S.i--;S.flipped=false;renderCard()}
    if(e.key==='ArrowRight'&&S.i<curSet().length-1){S.i++;S.flipped=false;renderCard()}
  } else if(S.mode==='quiz'){
    const n=+e.key; if(n>=1&&n<=4){ const b=document.querySelector(`.opt[data-n="${n-1}"]`); if(b&&!b.disabled) b.click(); }
  }
});

let sx=0,sy=0;
document.addEventListener('touchstart',e=>{sx=e.touches[0].clientX;sy=e.touches[0].clientY},{passive:true});
document.addEventListener('touchend',e=>{
  if(S.mode!=='card') return;
  const dx=e.changedTouches[0].clientX-sx,dy=e.changedTouches[0].clientY-sy;
  if(Math.abs(dx)<55||Math.abs(dy)>50) return;
  if(dx<0&&S.i<curSet().length-1){S.i++;S.flipped=false;renderCard()}
  if(dx>0&&S.i>0){S.i--;S.flipped=false;renderCard()}
},{passive:true});

setInterval(()=>{ if(S.mode==='exam'&&S.exam&&!S.exam.done){ const h=document.querySelector('.examhead b:last-child'); if(h){ const ms=Date.now()-S.exam.started; h.textContent=`${String(Math.floor(ms/60000)).padStart(2,'0')}:${String(Math.floor(ms/1000)%60).padStart(2,'0')}`; } } },1000);

(async function init(){
  known=(await store.get('hanja:known'))||{};
  const last=await store.get('hanja:last');
  if(last&&DATA[last.level]){ S.level=last.level; S.cum=!!last.cum; S.set=Math.min(last.set||0,Math.max(0,Math.ceil(scope().length/SET_SIZE)-1)); }
  render();
  setInterval(()=>store.set('hanja:last',{level:S.level,set:S.set,cum:S.cum}),4000);
})();
